[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625796793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102210#issuecomment-2625796793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102210","id":2625796793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cgnq5","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T23:03:15Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T23:03:15Z","body":"Do you have a test project that can be used to reproduce the bug and validate the fix? I suspect such issues may also be system/OS specific so some testing to confirm the fix would be good.\r\n\r\nI checked the code a bit, as I was wondering whether other things should be updated from `float` to `double`. There's notably the \"history\" floats in `Processor` which seemed relevant. I followed the trail a bit, noticed that `Processor::process` is never used, nor `Processor::process_one_interp`, and `Processor::process_one` indeed takes floats from `servers/audio/effects/audio_effect_filter.cpp`.\r\n\r\nSo that means in `process_one` we're now multiplying floats and doubles. I guess that promotes the calculation to double precision before casting back to float in `p_sample`?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625796793/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2626231797","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102210#issuecomment-2626231797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102210","id":2626231797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ciR31","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T03:40:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T03:40:39Z","body":"The audio part of the engine still contains lots of dead and legacy code, e.g. `AudioFilterSW::get_response` is also unused.\r\nfloat/double seems to be used rather arbitrarily. I also noticed the history floats, but the computations using those are numerically stable, so it should be fine. However, I'm not opposed to changing those also to double (or all in the filter code), which shouldn't make a difference performance-wise.\r\n\r\nI could provide a test project after asking the person for permission tomorrow.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2626231797/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627269684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102210#issuecomment-2627269684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102210","id":2627269684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cmPQ0","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T13:00:25Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T13:00:25Z","body":"Here it is. Audio cuts out at around 15s in.\r\nLike you suspected, the problem depends on the platform, hardware, audio processing workload, etc. so it might work fine for you.\r\n\r\nSince it's too large for github, you can download it here:\r\nhttps://bwsyncandshare.kit.edu/s/Jq5CwjTEgenw5QZ\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627269684/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650327144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102210#issuecomment-2650327144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102210","id":2650327144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d-Mho","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T10:02:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T10:02:19Z","body":"> Here it is. Audio cuts out at around 15s in. Like you suspected, the problem depends on the platform, hardware, audio processing workload, etc. so it might work fine for you.\r\n> \r\n> Since it's too large for github, you can download it here: https://bwsync